    "Closing market odds are the single strongest predictor available; use as prior/benchmark.",
    "xG beats raw goals at predicting future goals; stabilises in 10-15 matches vs 30-40.",
    "Referee explains more card variance than the teams do - never model cards without it.",
    "Head-to-head is the weakest item: small n, stale rosters. Near-zero weight.",
    "Practical zero-key stack: fdcouk + espn + understat + clubelo + openmeteo covers ~90%."
